Matt 19:1 , Christ heals the sick;
Matt 19:3 , answers the Pharisees concerning divorcement;
Matt 19:10 , shows when marriage is necessary;
Matt 19:13 , receives little children;
Matt 19:16 , instructs the young man how to attain eternal life;
Matt 19:20 , and how to be perfect;
Matt 19:23 , tells his disciples how hard it is for a rich man to enter into the kingdom of God;
Matt 19:27 , and promises reward to those that forsake anything to follow him.
